    "title": "Austin police arrest 3, seize nearly 5 ounces of meth following neighborhood complaints - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tara Brolley ,\n8 hours ago What started as neighborhood complaints about drugs, firearms and arson at an east Austin home ended with three arrests and the confiscation of around five ounces of methamphetamine. Members of the Austin Police Department's North Metro Tactical Unit conducted an operation on Monday in the 1400 block of Broadmoor Drive... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
